==Bengali==

===Etymology===
{{slbor|bn|sa|यशस्|যশস্}}. Compare {{cog|as|যশ}}, {{cog|hi|यश}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{bn-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{bn-noun}}

# [[fame]], [[renown]], [[glory]]
#: {{syn|bn|কীর্তি|খ্যাতি|সুনাম}}
#: {{ux|bn|তিনি তাঁর '''যশের''' জন্য সর্বত্র পরিচিত।|He is known everywhere for his '''fame'''.}}
# [[honour]], [[prestige]], [[repute]]
#: {{ux|bn|'''যশ''' অর্জন করা সহজ নয়।|It is not easy to earn '''prestige'''.}}

